[0-0] Documents
[0-0] DOCX document production skills, published as an official ZCode plugin. Includes a read-only workspace viewer for shared reading, search, references and captures.
[0-0] PDF
[0-0] PDF document production skills, published as an official ZCode plugin. Includes a read-only workspace viewer for shared reading, search, references and captures.
[0-0] Presentations
[0-0] PPTX presentation production skills, published as an official ZCode plugin. Includes a read-only workspace viewer for shared reading, search, references and captures.
[0-0] Spreadsheets
[0-0] XLSX spreadsheet production skills, published as an official ZCode plugin. Includes a read-only workspace viewer for shared reading, search, references and captures.
[0-0] Productivity
[0-0] Browser Use
[0-0] Built-in browser automation runtime and guidance for Desktop IAB and explicitly enabled CLI-managed headless CDP: open, navigate, inspect, click, type, screenshot, record workspace WebM videos, and verify web pages and local dev targets.
[0-0] Computer Use
[0-0] Computer Use: drive desktop applications with mouse, keyboard, and UI element control.
[0-0] Image Search
[0-0] Connect a user-configured image-search MCP service.
[0-0] Visualize
[0-0] Create interactive explanations, charts and design previews in ZCode conversations.
[0-0] Developer Tools
[0-0] Android Emulator
[0-0] Provides Android development workflows and emulator automation for ZCode.
[0-0] iOS Simulator
[0-0] Provides iOS development workflows and simulator automation for ZCode.
[0-0] Superpowers
[0-0] The Superpowers methodology skills: brainstorming, planning, TDD, systematic debugging, code review, and branch discipline.
[0-0] Utilities
[0-0] Plugin Creator
[0-0] Develop and validate ZCode plugins through a local dev marketplace, installation, trials and updates.
[0-0] Skill Creator
[0-0] Create, edit, and iterate local ZCode skills.
[0-0] ZCode Guide
[0-0] ZCode usage and self-diagnosis guide: teaches agents and users how to configure MCP servers, commands, skills, hooks, and plugins, and how to locate and fix configuration problems for each.
[0-0] Other
[0-0] Node Repl Host
[0-0] Shared node_repl runtime host for ZCode official capabilities. Not user-facing: it carries no skill and appears in no marketplace listing; Browser Use and Computer Use enable it and contribute their own skills, docs and runtime assets.
